125:T47e,PP-H recyclate ex BigBags. Successfully used in automotive compounds.

## Material information

**Material type:** Regranulate

**Polymer:** PP-H - 100%

**Colour category:** mixed

**Granule shape:** Lens shaped

#### Technical properties

| **Physical properties** | **Test standard** | **Value** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Density | ISO 1183 | 0.93 - 0.94 g/cm³ |

| **Mechanical properties** | **Test standard** | **Value** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Tensile strength | ISO 527 | 26 - 30 MPa |
| Strain at break | ISO 527 | 360 - 380 % |
| Stress at break | ISO 527 | 13 - 15 MPa |

| **Rheological properties** | **Test standard** | **Value** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| MFR (230°C/2.16kg) | ISO 1133 | 3 - 6g/10 min |

#### Information about the recyclate

| **Purity** | Similar to type |
| --- | --- |
| **Origin** | Industrial and commercial packaging |

#### Additional information

**Product description:** PP MFI 3-6

If you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact me.

**Andreas Bastian**, Founder and Managing Director\
